ing in before?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1442_s_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1442_s_34","text":"Come again?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1442_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1442_s_35","text":"I was slumbering in there for so long","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1442_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1442_s_36","text":"that I think my body got accustomed to it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1442_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1442_s_37","text":"That's why","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1442_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1442_s_38","text":"I can't fall asleep elsewhere.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1442_s_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1442_s_39","text":"I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1442_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1442_s_40","text":"I need that coffin","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1442_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1442_s_41","text":"for my sleep,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1442_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1442_s_42","text":"and my beauty.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1442_s_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1442_s_43","text":"The only thing is...","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1442_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1442_s_44","text":"What?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1442_s_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1442_s_45","text":"I'm pretty sure Behemoth destroyed that coffin.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1442_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"mi